 "short_name": "Lekwa-Teemane",
 "_doc": "Two layouts. 2026 bills (6): the same trilingual 'TAX INVOICE / BELASTINGFAKTUUR' ledger as Kgatelopele (period decimals) with meter detail rows; they print Kgatelopele's VAT number in the masthead. 2025 bills (4): an older 'STATEMENT / TAX INVOICE' (Vat / Levy Amount / Credit / Balance, M/D/Y or Y/M/D dates, own VAT number, no meter rows, readings wrapped away). Fingerprint: 'Lekwa-Teemane Local Municipality' + either VAT number. Electricity: Electricity Consumption - KWH (kWh from the description, readings from the detail row of the non-zero register -> standard), Basic Elec and Network Access Charge (-> other); interest and 'Payment - Electricity ...' lines are excluded. Ex VAT = Levy/Debit - VAT per line. IDENTITY x_elec_resid_r = Amount Due - Balance Brought Forward + payments - non-electricity debits - (VAT Total - non-electricity VAT): 0.00 gap on all 10 bills; the 2025 layout prints no VAT Total, so there the VAT part uses the summed line VATs (balance part still independent). 10 bills checked; kWh is the same estimated/averaged figure on most months, as printed.",
